OL,3,GNEWSAFailings contributed to arson
OL,4,Aattack deaths, family tells inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a mother who was murdered
OL,7,Fin an arson attack along with her four
OL,8,Fyoungest children have said failings by
OL,9,Fpolice and local authorities
OL,10,Fcontributed to their deaths, an inquest
OL,11,Fheard.
OL,13,FMichelle Pearson, 37, died nearly two
OL,14,Fyears after her home in Walkden,
OL,15,FSalford, was firebombed on 11 December
OL,16,F2017, killing her four youngest
OL,17,Fchildren.
OL,19,FThe inquest at Bolton Coroner's Court
OL,20,Fheard Michelle had called police
OL,21,Fseveral times and told social workers
OL,22,Fshe wanted to move before the murders.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
