OL,4,Aattack deaths, family tells inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinal submissions from lawyers for the
OL,7,Ffamily, Greater Manchester Police and
OL,8,Fothers were heard earlier. GMP said the
OL,9,Fevidence did not support that their
OL,10,Finaction had probably caused or
OL,11,Fcontributed to the deaths.
